            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run>This filter assists you to choose between one of either:
- Development &amp; Performance over Time of Auto Accept vendors </run>
                <run fontcolor='#59a14f'>(A)</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>: aggregated metrics per day of all Auto Accept vendors who had orders during the day.</run>
                <run>
-  Aggregated comparison between Before &amp; After for all vendors from the selected Cohort Period </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4e79a7'>(B)</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>, compare behaviors of vendors before Auto Accept was activated &amp; after after Auto Accept was activated (before T0 &amp; after T0)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>The metrics end with </run>
                <run fontcolor='#59a14f' italic='true'>(A) </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>or </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' italic='true'>(B) </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>are only applicable for the corresponding view </run>
                <run fontcolor='#59a14f' italic='true'>(A)</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'> or </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' italic='true'>(B)</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
